// Rank1Fn.fol — package source file
// Spec: language-ref.md > Rank-1 Syntax 2 — Named type alias
//
// A Rank-1 alias mentions the surrounding declaration's type variable. `T` is
// fixed by the generic declaration that uses this alias, so the alias itself
// carries no quantifier.

@co.dap.generic(type={T:{variance:invariant}})
_ co.lang.type = (T, T)->(T);
